<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>HRMS - Leave Approval & Journey Workflow</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; margin: 20px; }
  h1 { font-size: 22pt; color: #1e40af; border-bottom: 3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  h2 { font-size: 15pt; color: #0f172a; border-left: 5px solid #2563eb; padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  h3 { font-size: 12pt; color: #334155; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 10pt; }
  th { background-color: #1e40af; color: #ffffff; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; }
  td { padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; vertical-align: top; }
  tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f8fafc; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .badge-lm { background-color: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; border: 1px solid #fde68a; }
  .badge-hod { background-color: #e0e7ff; color: #3730a3; border: 1px solid #c7d2fe; }
  .badge-hr { background-color: #ccfbf1; color: #115e59; border: 1px solid #99f6e4; }
  .callout { background-color: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 14px 0; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }
  .callout-success { background-color: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 14px 0; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }
  .step-box { background: #f1f5f9; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .code { font-family: Consolas, monospace; background: #e2e8f0; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 10pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>HRMS - Leave Approval & Journey Workflow Documentation</h1>
<p><strong>System:</strong> Cybaem Tech & Nexora Solutions HRMS<br>
<strong>Workflow Engine:</strong> Multi-Level Approval (Employee → Line Manager → HOD → HR Intimation → Complete)<br>
<strong>Document Version:</strong> 2.0 (Updated 29-Oct-2026)<br>
<strong>Author:</strong> HRMS Engineering Team</p>

<div class="callout-success">
  <strong>Workflow Status:</strong> Fully Implemented & Verified End-to-End.<br>
  All 11 departments now have configured Line Managers and HODs using existing company records without synthetic data.
</div>

<h2>1. Complete Leave Approval Path</h2>
<p>The system enforces a strict 4-stage sequential approval and intimation pipeline:</p>

<div class="step-box">
  <h3>Step 1: Employee Submits Leave Request</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Actor:</strong> Any active employee.</li>
    <li><strong>Action:</strong> Applies via Sidebar → Leave Management → Apply for Leave.</li>
    <li><strong>System State:</strong> Request initialized with <span class="code">status: "pending"</span>, <span class="code">approvalStage: "line_manager"</span>.</li>
    <li><strong>Notification:</strong> Sent to the designated <strong>Line Manager (Department Manager)</strong>.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="step-box">
  <h3>Step 2: Line Manager Approval (Approval #1)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Actor:</strong> Department Manager / Line Manager (e.g., Amit Sharma for Engineering).</li>
    <li><strong>Review Screen:</strong> Leave Management → Pending Approvals (Stage 1 Filter).</li>
    <li><strong>Action:</strong> Click <strong>"Approve Line Manager (#1)"</strong> or <strong>"Reject"</strong>.</li>
    <li><strong>System State:</strong> Logs <span class="code">lineManagerApprovedById</span>, <span class="code">lineManagerApprovedAt</span>, comments. Advances to <span class="code">approvalStage: "hod"</span>.</li>
    <li><strong>Notification:</strong> Employee receives Stage 1 approval notice; HOD receives Stage 2 review prompt.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="step-box">
  <h3>Step 3: Head of Department (HOD) Approval (Approval #2)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Actor:</strong> Head of Department / Executive (e.g., Rohan Bhosale for Cybaem Tech; Vijay Menon for Nexora Engineering).</li>
    <li><strong>Review Screen:</strong> Leave Management → Pending Approvals (Stage 2 Filter).</li>
    <li><strong>Action:</strong> Click <strong>"Final HOD Approval (#2)"</strong> or <strong>"Reject"</strong>.</li>
    <li><strong>System State:</strong> Logs <span class="code">hodApprovedById</span>, <span class="code">approvedById</span>, <span class="code">approvedAt</span>. Sets <span class="code">status: "approved"</span>, <span class="code">approvalStage: "completed"</span>.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="step-box">
  <h3>Step 4: HR Intimation & Records</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Actor:</strong> System Automated Service.</li>
    <li><strong>Action:</strong> Immediately dispatches an intimation notification to all HR Administrators.</li>
    <li><strong>Content:</strong> Full record with employee name, department, leave dates, Line Manager approver, and HOD approver.</li>
    <li><strong>System State:</strong> Logs <span class="code">hrIntimatedAt</span> timestamp.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="step-box">
  <h3>Step 5: End of Journey</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Employee receives celebration notification of full approval.</li>
    <li>Leave days are deducted from the employee balance.</li>
    <li>Audit timeline and badge display full green checkpoints.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

