<h2>3. Comp Off Leave Policy Rules</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Validity Period:</strong> Comp Off leaves must be availed within <strong>30 calendar days</strong>.</li>
  <li><strong>Quota Isolation:</strong> Comp Off does not deduct from the standard 1.5 monthly paid leave quota.</li>
  <li><strong>HR Admin Policy Modal:</strong> Accessible via the <em>"Comp Off Policy ⚙️"</em> button in Leave Management. HR Admins can toggle Comp Off availability, edit validity days, and mandate Department Head approval.</li>
</ul>

