<h3>Verification Steps:</h3>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Submit as Employee (Gauri Dhapte):</strong>
    <br>Log in with Gauri's credentials → Go to <em>Leave Management</em> → Click <em>Apply for Leave</em> → Select <em>Comp Off</em> or <em>Annual Leave</em> within 30 days → Submit.
    <br><em>Result:</em> Card displays <em>"Stage 1: Line Manager Review (Amit Sharma)"</em>.
  </li>
  <li><strong>Approve as Line Manager (Amit Sharma):</strong>
    <br>Log in as Amit Sharma → Go to <em>Leave Management</em> → Click <em>Pending Approvals</em> → Click <strong>"Approve Line Manager (#1)"</strong>.
    <br><em>Result:</em> Card status advances to <em>"Stage 2: HOD Review (Rohan Bhosale)"</em>.
  </li>
  <li><strong>Approve as HOD (Rohan Bhosale):</strong>
    <br>Log in as Rohan Bhosale → Go to <em>Leave Management</em> → Filter by <em>Stage 2: HOD</em> → Click <strong>"Final HOD Approval (#2)"</strong>.
    <br><em>Result:</em> Overall status becomes <strong>Approved</strong> with green checkmarks.
  </li>
  <li><strong>Verify HR Intimation:</strong>
    <br>Log in as Nikita Nagargoje (HR) → Click the top bell notification icon.
    <br><em>Result:</em> An official intimation record is displayed: <em>"HR Intimation: Leave Approved for Gauri Dhapte (Dual approvals: Amit Sharma + Rohan Bhosale)"</em>.
  </li>
  <li><strong>Audit Timeline:</strong>
    <br>Click the <strong>Eye (View Details)</strong> icon on the leave card to review the complete 5-step visual journey with timestamps.
  </li>
</ol>

<h2>5. Database & API Schema Details</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Field Name</th>
      <th>Type</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><span class="code">approvalStage</span></td><td>text</td><td>Current stage: 'line_manager' | 'hod' | 'completed' | 'rejected'</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">lineManagerApprovedById</span></td><td>integer</td><td>User ID of Line Manager who granted Approval #1</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">lineManagerApprovedAt</span></td><td>timestamp</td><td>Exact date & time of Line Manager approval</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">lineManagerComments</span></td><td>text</td><td>Review remarks entered by Line Manager</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">hodApprovedById</span></td><td>integer</td><td>User ID of HOD who granted Approval #2</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">hodApprovedAt</span></td><td>timestamp</td><td>Exact date & time of HOD approval</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">hodComments</span></td><td>text</td><td>Review remarks entered by HOD</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">hrIntimatedAt</span></td><td>timestamp</td><td>Timestamp when HR intimation was dispatched</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">rejectedById</span></td><td>integer</td><td>User ID of reviewer who rejected the request</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="code">rejectionStage</span></td><td>text</td><td>Stage at which rejection took place ('line_manager' | 'hod')</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

